      <template v-else><div class="module-card cache-card"><div class="card-heading"><div><h3>封面缓存</h3><p>本机缓存的 Steam 封面图片</p></div><el-button @click="loadStats">刷新</el-button></div><div class="cache-stats"><div><strong>{{ imageStats.images||0 }}</strong><span>张图片</span></div><div><strong>{{ imageStats.games||0 }}</strong><span>款游戏</span></div><div><strong>{{ imageMb }} MB</strong><span>占用空间</span></div></div><small class="muted">{{ imageStats.root||'data/images' }}</small></div><div class="module-card backup-box"><div class="card-heading"><div><h3>数据备份</h3><p>核心表压缩备份，保留最近 7 份</p></div><el-button type="primary" :loading="saving" @click="createBackup">立即备份</el-button></div><div v-for="b in backups" :key="b.name" class="backup-row"><span>{{ b.name }}</span><span>{{ (b.size/1024/1024).toFixed(2) }} MB</span></div><small v-if="!backups.length" class="muted">还没有备份</small></div></template>
