const platforms=[{value:'steam',label:'Steam'},{value:'sonkwo',label:'杉果'},{value:'gog',label:'GOG'},{value:'humble',label:'Humble'},{value:'itad',label:'ITAD'},{value:'steampy',label:'SteamPy'}];
const games=ref([]),gameStats=ref({}),gameQuery=ref(''),gamePlatform=ref(''),gameSync=ref(''),gamePage=ref(1),gamePageSize=ref(20),gamePages=ref(1),gameTotal=ref(0),gameView=ref('directory'),gameDialog=ref(false),activeGame=ref(null),gameDescription=ref(''),gameBlocked=ref(false);
const visitorTabs=[{value:'visits',label:'访问明细'},{value:'review',label:'异常审核'},{value:'security',label:'封禁与白名单'}],visitorView=ref('visits'),visitorFilter=ref('visits'),visitorIp=ref(''),visitorPath=ref(''),visitors=ref([]),visitorSummary=ref({}),visitorPage=ref(1),visitorTotal=ref(0),reviews=ref([]),blacklist=ref([]),whitelist=ref([]),abuse=ref([]),newBlockIp=ref(''),newBlockNote=ref(''),newAllowIp=ref(''),newAllowNote=ref('');
const announcements=ref([]),announcement=reactive({id:null,title:'',body:'',level:'info',active:true,startsAt:null,endsAt:null});
const settingsSchema=ref(null),settingValues=reactive({}),clearSecrets=reactive({}),settingQuery=ref(''),expandedSettings=ref([]),settingsDirty=ref(false);
const priceReport=ref({}),daily=ref([]),views=ref([]),imageStats=ref({}),backups=ref([]),aggregateViews=ref(false),statsView=ref('price');
const taskLimit=ref(200),taskSleep=ref(2),backfillLimit=ref(200000),backfillBatch=ref(100),backfillSleep=ref(3000),backfillFallback=ref(10),syncStatus=ref(null),backfillRunning=ref(false);
function api(path,options={}){return fetch(path,{credentials:'same-origin',...options,headers:{'content-type':'application/json',...(options.headers||{})}}).then(async r=>{const t=await r.text();let d={};try{d=t?JSON.parse(t):{}}catch{}if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error||`HTTP ${r.status}`);return d;});}
function json(method,body){return {method,body:JSON.stringify(body)};}
function price(cents){return cents==null?'—':`¥${(Number(cents)/100).toFixed(2)}`;}
function dateTime(value){return value?new Date(value).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{hour12:false}):'—';}
function notifyError(e){ElMessage.error(e?.message||String(e));}
async function run(action){saving.value=true;try{await action();}catch(e){notifyError(e);}finally{saving.value=false;}}

async function loadGames(page=gamePage.value){loading.value=true;gamePage.value=page;try{const qs=new URLSearchParams({page:String(page),pageSize:String(gamePageSize.value),q:gameQuery.value.trim(),platform:gamePlatform.value,sync:gameSync.value});const [d,s]=await Promise.all([api(`/api/admin/games?${qs}`),api('/api/admin/games/stats')]);games.value=d.games||[];gameTotal.value=d.total||0;gamePages.value=d.pages||1;gameStats.value=s.stats||{};}catch(e){notifyError(e);}finally{loading.value=false;}}
function refreshGames(){return loadGames(gamePage.value);}
async function changeGameSize(n){gamePageSize.value=n;await loadGames(1);}
async function toggleGame(row){await run(async()=>{await api(`/api/games/${row.steam_appid}/blocked`,json('POST',{blocked:!row.blocked}));ElMessage.success(row.blocked?'游戏已启用':'游戏已禁用');await refreshGames();});}
async function deleteGame(row){try{await ElMessageBox.confirm(`删除“${row.name}”？数据会进入回收站，可恢复。`,'确认删除',{type:'warning',confirmButtonText:'移入回收站'});await api(row.steam_appid?`/api/games/${row.steam_appid}/deleted`:`/api/games/id/${row.id}/deleted`,json('POST',{deleted:true}));ElMessage.success('已移入回收站');await refreshGames();}catch(e){if(e!=='cancel'&&e!=='close')notifyError(e);}}
async function editGame(row){activeGame.value=row;gameBlocked.value=Boolean(row.blocked);try{const d=await api(`/api/games/${row.steam_appid}`);gameDescription.value=d.game?.description||'';}catch(e){notifyError(e);return;}gameDialog.value=true;}
async function saveGame(){if(!activeGame.value)return;await run(async()=>{await api(`/api/games/${activeGame.value.steam_appid}/description`,json('POST',{description:gameDescription.value,overwrite:true}));await api(`/api/games/${activeGame.value.steam_appid}/blocked`,json('POST',{blocked:gameBlocked.value}));gameDialog.value=false;ElMessage.success('游戏资料已保存');await refreshGames();});}

async function loadVisitors(page=visitorPage.value){loading.value=true;visitorPage.value=page;try{const qs=new URLSearchParams({page:String(page),pageSize:'50',filter:visitorFilter.value,ip:visitorIp.value.trim(),path:visitorPath.value.trim()});const d=await api(`/api/admin/visitors?${qs}`);visitors.value=d.rows||[];visitorTotal.value=d.total||0;visitorSummary.value=d.summary||{};}catch(e){notifyError(e);}finally{loading.value=false;}}
async function loadReviews(){loading.value=true;try{const d=await api('/api/admin/reviews?status=pending');reviews.value=d.reviews||[];}catch(e){notifyError(e);}finally{loading.value=false;}}
async function loadSecurity(){loading.value=true;try{const [b,w,a]=await Promise.all([api('/api/admin/blacklist'),api('/api/admin/whitelist'),api('/api/admin/abuse?limit=100')]);blacklist.value=b.ips||[];whitelist.value=w.ips||[];abuse.value=a.abuse||[];}catch(e){notifyError(e);}finally{loading.value=false;}}
function loadVisitorView(){if(visitorView.value==='visits')loadVisitors(1);else if(visitorView.value==='review')loadReviews();else loadSecurity();}
async function banIp(ip){try{const {value:note}=await ElMessageBox.prompt(`封禁 ${ip} 后，该地址将无法访问站点。`,'确认封禁',{inputPlaceholder:'备注（可选）',confirmButtonText:'封禁',cancelButtonText:'取消'});await api('/api/admin/blacklist',json('POST',{ip,note:note?.trim()||''}));ElMessage.success('IP 已加入黑名单');await loadSecurity();}catch(e){if(e!=='cancel'&&e!=='close')notifyError(e);}}
async function addBlacklist(){const ip=newBlockIp.value.trim();if(!ip)return ElMessage.warning('请填写 IP 或 CIDR');await run(async()=>{await api('/api/admin/blacklist',json('POST',{ip,note:newBlockNote.value.trim()}));newBlockIp.value='';newBlockNote.value='';ElMessage.success('已封禁');await loadSecurity();});}
async function removeBlacklist(ip){await run(async()=>{await api(`/api/admin/blacklist/${encodeURIComponent(ip)}`,{method:'DELETE'});ElMessage.success('已解封');await loadSecurity();});}
async function addWhitelist(existingIp){const ip=existingIp||newAllowIp.value.trim();if(!ip)return ElMessage.warning('请填写 IP 或 CIDR');await run(async()=>{await api('/api/admin/whitelist',json('POST',{ip,note:existingIp?'':newAllowNote.value.trim()}));newAllowIp.value='';newAllowNote.value='';ElMessage.success('已加入白名单');await loadSecurity();});}
async function removeWhitelist(ip){await run(async()=>{await api(`/api/admin/whitelist/${encodeURIComponent(ip)}`,{method:'DELETE'});ElMessage.success('已移出白名单');await loadSecurity();});}
async function unbanAbuse(ip){await run(async()=>{await api(`/api/admin/abuse/${encodeURIComponent(ip)}`,{method:'DELETE'});ElMessage.success('临时封禁已解除');await loadSecurity();});}
async function reviewAction(row,mode){await run(async()=>{await api('/api/admin/reviews/approve',json('POST',{id:row.id,mode}));ElMessage.success(mode==='device'?'设备已封禁':'IP 已封禁');await loadReviews();});}
async function ignoreReview(row){await run(async()=>{await api('/api/admin/reviews/reject',json('POST',{id:row.id}));ElMessage.success('已忽略这条记录');await loadReviews();});}

async function loadAnnouncements(){loading.value=true;try{const d=await api('/api/admin/announcements');announcements.value=d.announcements||[];}catch(e){notifyError(e);}finally{loading.value=false;}}
function resetAnnouncement(){Object.assign(announcement,{id:null,title:'',body:'',level:'info',active:true,startsAt:null,endsAt:null});}
function editAnnouncement(a){Object.assign(announcement,{id:a.id,title:a.title||'',body:a.body||'',level:a.level||'info',active:Boolean(a.active),startsAt:a.starts_at||null,endsAt:a.ends_at||null});window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});}
function levelLabel(level){return ({critical:'重要',warning:'提醒',info:'通知'})[level]||'通知';}
async function saveAnnouncement(){if(!announcement.title.trim()||!announcement.body.trim())return ElMessage.warning('标题和正文都要填写');await run(async()=>{const payload={title:announcement.title.trim(),body:announcement.body.trim(),level:announcement.level,active:announcement.active,startsAt:announcement.startsAt?new Date(announcement.startsAt).toISOString():null,endsAt:announcement.endsAt?new Date(announcement.endsAt).toISOString():null};await api(announcement.id?`/api/admin/announcements/${announcement.id}`:'/api/admin/announcements',json(announcement.id?'PATCH':'POST',payload));ElMessage.success(announcement.id?'通知已更新':'通知已发布');resetAnnouncement();await loadAnnouncements();});}
async function removeAnnouncement(id){try{await ElMessageBox.confirm('删除后无法恢复，确定继续？','删除通知',{type:'warning'});await api(`/api/admin/announcements/${id}`,{method:'DELETE'});ElMessage.success('已删除');await loadAnnouncements();}catch(e){if(e!=='cancel'&&e!=='close')notifyError(e);}}

function fieldsByGroup(groupId){const q=settingQuery.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase();return (settingsSchema.value?.fields||[]).filter(f=>f.group===groupId&&(!q||`${f.label} ${f.key} ${f.help||''}`.toLocaleLowerCase().includes(q)));}
const filteredGroups=computed(()=>{const groups=settingsSchema.value?.groups||[];return groups.filter(g=>fieldsByGroup(g.id).length);});
function visibleSettingCount(id){return fieldsByGroup(id).length;}
function sourceLabel(src){return ({database:'数据库',env:'环境变量',default:'默认值'})[src]||src||'默认值';}
function settingId(key){return `setting-${String(key).replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9_-]/g,'-')}`;}
function secretPlaceholder(key){return settingsSchema.value?.secrets?.[key]?.hasValue?'已设置，留空保持原值':'尚未设置';}
async function loadSettings(){loading.value=true;try{const d=await api('/api/admin/settings');settingsSchema.value=d;for(const key of Object.keys(settingValues))delete settingValues[key];for(const field of d.fields||[]){settingValues[field.key]=field.type==='secret'?'':d.values?.[field.key]??field.default??(field.type==='bool'?false:'');}for(const key of Object.keys(clearSecrets))delete clearSecrets[key];expandedSettings.value=(d.groups||[]).slice(0,1).map(g=>g.id);settingsDirty.value=false;}catch(e){notifyError(e);}finally{loading.value=false;}}
async function revealSecret(key){try{const d=await api(`/api/admin/settings/value?key=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`);settingValues[key]=d.value??'';ElMessage.info('密钥已载入输入框；保存会保留该值');}catch(e){notifyError(e);}}
async function saveSettings(){const values={};for(const f of settingsSchema.value?.fields||[]){const v=settingValues[f.key];if(f.type==='secret'){if(clearSecrets[f.key])values[f.key]=null;else if(String(v??'').trim()!=='')values[f.key]=v;}else if(f.type==='int'){values[f.key]=v===''||v==null?null:Number(v);}else if(f.type==='bool')values[f.key]=Boolean(v);else values[f.key]=v;}await run(async()=>{const d=await api('/api/admin/settings',json('POST',{values}));settingsSchema.value=d;for(const f of d.fields||[]){if(f.type==='secret')settingValues[f.key]='';else settingValues[f.key]=d.values?.[f.key]??f.default??'';}settingsDirty.value=false;ElMessage.success(`已保存 ${d.keys?.length||0} 项设置`);});}
watch(settingQuery,()=>{if(settingQuery.value.trim())expandedSettings.value=(settingsSchema.value?.groups||[]).map(g=>g.id);});
watch(gameView,(view)=>{if(view==='tasks')loadSyncStatus();else loadGames(1);});

const priceMetrics=computed(()=>[{label:'降价',value:priceReport.value.drops||0,tone:'metric-red'},{label:'涨价',value:priceReport.value.rises||0,tone:''},{label:'新史低',value:priceReport.value.newLows||0,tone:'metric-green'},{label:'价格变化',value:priceReport.value.changed||0,tone:''}]);
const priceChanges=computed(()=>[...(priceReport.value.topDrops||[]),...(priceReport.value.topRises||[])]);
const viewRows=computed(()=>{const rows=views.value.slice();if(!aggregateViews.value)return rows;const map=new Map();for(const v of rows){const key=v.name||v.path;const current=map.get(key)||{name:v.name,path:'多个页面',views:0,last_at:v.last_at};current.views+=v.views;if(v.last_at>current.last_at)current.last_at=v.last_at;map.set(key,current);}return [...map.values()].sort((a,b)=>b.views-a.views);});
const imageMb=computed(()=>((imageStats.value.bytes||0)/1024/1024).toFixed(1));
async function loadStats(){loading.value=true;try{const [r,v,i,b]=await Promise.all([api('/api/admin/reports/price?hours=24&limit=10&days=7'),api('/api/admin/views'),api('/api/admin/images'),api('/api/admin/backups')]);priceReport.value=r.report||{};daily.value=r.daily||[];views.value=v.views||[];imageStats.value=i.images||{};backups.value=b.backups||[];}catch(e){notifyError(e);}finally{loading.value=false;}}
async function createBackup(){await run(async()=>{const d=await api('/api/admin/backup',json('POST',{}));backups.value=d.backups||backups.value;ElMessage.success(`备份完成：${d.result?.rows||0} 行`);});}

async function loadSyncStatus(){try{const [s,b]=await Promise.all([api('/api/admin/sync/status'),api('/api/admin/backfill/status')]);syncStatus.value=s;backfillRunning.value=Boolean(b.running);}catch(e){notifyError(e);}}
async function startSync(mode){await run(async()=>{await api('/api/admin/sync',json('POST',{mode,limit:taskLimit.value,sleep:taskSleep.value}));ElMessage.success('同步任务已提交到服务器');await loadSyncStatus();});}
async function startBackfill(){await run(async()=>{await api('/api/admin/backfill',json('POST',{limit:backfillLimit.value,batch:backfillBatch.value,sleep:backfillSleep.value,fallback:backfillFallback.value}));ElMessage.success('回填任务已提交到服务器');await loadSyncStatus();});}
async function stopBackfill(){await run(async()=>{await api('/api/admin/backfill/stop',json('POST',{}));ElMessage.success('已请求停止回填');await loadSyncStatus();});}

watch(()=>props.section,(section)=>{if(section==='games')loadGames(1);else if(section==='visitors')loadVisitorView();else if(section==='announcements')loadAnnouncements();else if(section==='settings')loadSettings();else if(section==='stats')loadStats();});
onMounted(()=>{if(props.section==='games')loadGames(1);else if(props.section==='visitors')loadVisitorView();else if(props.section==='announcements')loadAnnouncements();else if(props.section==='settings')loadSettings();else if(props.section==='stats')loadStats();});
const statusTimer=setInterval(()=>{if(props.section==='games'&&gameView.value==='tasks')loadSyncStatus();},10000);
onBeforeUnmount(()=>clearInterval(statusTimer));
</script>

